@startuml
title [프로세스 관점] CSV 업로드 → 분석 파이프라인 → 답변 초안 (UC-01~04)
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName "Malgun Gothic"
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
autonumber

actor "담당자" as A
participant "React SPA" as UI
participant "FeedbackRouter" as R
participant "FeedbackService" as FS
participant "AnalysisService\n(BackgroundTask)" as AS
participant "Pipeline" as P
participant "SentimentFilter" as SF
participant "AIClient" as AI
participant "Repository" as DB

A -> UI : CSV 파일 선택
UI -> R : POST /api/feedbacks/upload
R -> FS : upload(file)
FS -> FS : 형식·필수 필드 검증
alt 형식 오류 (E1)
  FS --> UI : 400 오류 행 목록
else 정상
  FS -> DB : 피드백 일괄 저장 (status=미처리)
  FS --> UI : 202 batchId (1초 이내 응답)
  FS ->> AS : analyze(ids) 비동기 요청
end

loop 피드백마다
  AS -> P : run(ctx)
  P -> P : Validation → Cleansing
  P -> SF : process(ctx)
  SF -> AI : 감정 분석 요청 (timeout 5s)
  alt AI 장애·타임아웃 (E1)
    SF -> SF : RuleBasedSentimentAnalyzer로 대체
  end
  P -> P : Topic → Priority (긴급 태그 Decorator)
  AS -> DB : SentimentResult, Topic, PriorityScore 저장
end

A -> UI : 피드백 상세 열기
UI -> R : POST /api/feedbacks/{id}/drafts
R -> AS : (ResponseService) 전략 선택 → 초안 생성
R --> UI : 초안 (3초 이내)
A -> UI : 검토·수정 후 [확정]
UI -> R : PATCH /api/drafts/{id}/confirm
@enduml
